Consolidation provenance:
This repository consolidates four earlier standalone public repositories by Alexander S. Donahue:
1. 0thernes/hoggar-bound-lab (spectral floor, floor-saturating states, |Psi_{3m}>, N=4..5 ladders, Conjecture E, C3 binary optima)
2. 0thernes/hoggar-bound (initial third-moment bound prototype, TwoQubit & Witness Lean modules, tabu/exhaust C search, ILP checks)
3. 0thernes/contextuality-tensor-lab (exact degrees (7^k-5^k)/2 and (6^k-4^k)/2 for disjoint Mermin configurations)
4. 0thernes/contextuality-evidence-lab (exact sequential contextuality certificates and setting-bias attack)

